{
  "name": "iris",
  "label": "infographic house theme, clay and blue",
  "note": "The house theme, taken from branding/. Page is the mark's cream ground and the accent is its clay. The two sequential ramps are the mark's own two hue angles, 39.9 and 251.1 in OKLCH, which is why a ramp in this theme and the logo beside it are the same colour. Diverging runs blue to clay, the same inversion the mark is built on. The eight categorical slots are NOT the brand: a chart needs eight separable identities and the brand has two, so the remaining six were found by enumerating a hue grid and keeping only sets that clear every gate, with a 32 degree minimum hue gap so no two slots collapse into one family. Worst adjacent CVD dE is 11.6. This theme needs no waiver. Re-run validate_theme.py after any edit.",
